# Pairs with SetCaptureCompletes, under the fairness Spec asserts. The set's
# first lease is a GATE rather than a FENCE, so the finalize Marks that drain
# the delegation rows are refused while the drain waits for them: the drain
# can never pass, and only the fault path (which is not fair) could end the
# capture.
MODULE: SetCaptureCompletesFenceTakesGate
TARGET: SetCaptureCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the set capture fences with a gate, so the rows it drains can never finalize
PERTURBS: Fence

--- FIND
    /\ lease' = [T \in Trees |-> IF T \in Members THEN "fence" ELSE lease[T]]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: gate mode refuses the finalize Marks.
    /\ lease' = [T \in Trees |-> IF T \in Members THEN "gate" ELSE lease[T]]
--- END
